# Copy to .env.local to enable "Generate with AI". Two provider options —
# pick one, or leave both unset and the app defaults to the API if a key is
# present, otherwise the Claude Code CLI.

# Option 1: Anthropic API. Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/ —
# it stays server-side (never shipped to the browser).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Option 2: a local Claude Code CLI session (no API key needed here — it
# rides on whatever `claude` is already authenticated with on this machine).
# Requires the `claude` CLI installed and on PATH.
# AI_PROVIDER=claude-code
# CLAUDE_CODE_BIN=claude
# CLAUDE_CODE_MODEL=

# Force the provider explicitly instead of auto-detecting from ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.
# AI_PROVIDER=anthropic-api

# Optional: override the Chromium binary used for PDF export.
# Defaults to /opt/pw-browsers/chromium, else Playwright's bundled browser.
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_PATH=
